        "font size" : 10.909,
        "text color" : "[0.0]",
        "content" : "If the cone V+ in an ordered vector space X has a base D, then x ∈ D is extremal if and only if x is an extreme point of D, see [6, Lemma 1.5.19]. The following result by Krein and Milman is given, e.g., in [13, §II.10.5 on p.68]."
